          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 8,
          "text": "\"It looks like `rosbridge_server` uses the default reliability QoS policy (which in my case ends up being **Reliable**) and only specifies the depth.\" -- https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551",
          "urls": [
            "https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 9,
          "text": "\"Rosbridge Version (`roscat rosbridge_server package.xml | grep '<version>'`): 1.0.2 (more specifically 1a2c386)\" -- https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551",
          "urls": [
            "https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 10,
          "text": "\"ROS Version (`echo $ROS_DISTRO`): foxy\" -- https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551",
          "urls": [
            "https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 14,
          "text": "# https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/pull/690/files",
          "urls": [
            "https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/pull/690/files"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 28,
          "text": "        # - https://docs.ros.org/en/rolling/Concepts/About-Quality-of-Service-Settings.html",
          "urls": [
            "https://docs.ros.org/en/rolling/Concepts/About-Quality-of-Service-Settings.html"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 29,
          "text": "        # - https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551",
          "urls": [
            "https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 40,
          "text": "\"Subscriber QoS is automatically chosen based on available publishers to achieve compatible QoS settings in more cases.\" -- https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/pull/690",
          "urls": [
            "https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/pull/690"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 43,
          "text": "\"Run a ROS2 node that publishes data to a topic using **Best Effort** reliability.\" -- https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551",
          "urls": [
            "https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 44,
          "text": "\"ROS Version (`echo $ROS_DISTRO`): foxy\" -- https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551",
          "urls": [
            "https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 45,
          "text": "\"OS Version (`grep DISTRIB_CODENAME /etc/lsb-release`): focal\" -- https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite/issues/551",
          "urls": [
