          ]
        },
        {
          "line": 8,
          "text": "\"The correct way to handle this is to replace the standard messages that MATLAB uses to match the message definitions used by your external version of ROS.\" -- https://www.mathworks.com/matlabcentral/answers/394613-rosactionclient-failure-due-to-version-mismatch#answer_601519",
          "urls": [
            "https://www.mathworks.com/matlabcentral/answers/394613-rosactionclient-failure-due-to-version-mismatch#answer_601519"
